  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marine Litter and Mindset Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to achieve a sustained improvement in the cleanliness of Mumbai&apos;s beaches, rivers, and mangroves, while raising awareness among citizens and decision-makers about the environmental hazards of plastic pollution and the positive impact of a circular economy. The results from Mumbai have demonstrated the potential to inspire similar action at both national and global levels.</narrative>
  </description>
